        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Math Problems Handwriting</title>\n    <script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n    <script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            background-color: #d8d8d8;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 20px;\n            font-family: \"Kaiti\", \"STKaiti\", \"楷体\", serif;\n        }\n        .page {\n            background-color: #eceeeb;\n            max-width: 850px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 50px 60px;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n            font-size: 1.15rem;\n            line-height: 2.1;\n            color: #222;\n        }\n        .problem {\n            margin-bottom: 35px;\n        }\n        .question {\n            color: #a32626; /* Handwritten red ink color */\n        }\n        .q-line {\n            margin-left: 2em;\n        }\n        .solution {\n            color: #1a1a1a; /* Black ink color */\n        }\n        .method {\n            margin-left: 2.5em;\n        }\n        .step {\n            margin-left: 4.5em;\n        }\n        .step-indent {\n            margin-left: 6.5em;\n        }\n        .flex-row {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 3.5em;\n        }\n        /* Slightly larger font for equations to match handwriting proportions */\n        mjx-container {\n            font-size: 1.05em !important;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"page\">\n        <!-- Problem 2 -->\n        <div class=\"problem\">\n            <div class=\"question\">2. 光明小学师生100人共画了100幅画，老师1人画3幅，学生3人画1幅，</div>\n            <div class=\"question q-line\">画画的老师、学生各有多少人？</div>\n            <div class=\"solution\">\n                <div class=\"method\">分组法</div>\n                <div class=\"step\">1个老师和3个学生画的画的幅数： $3+1=4$(幅)</div>\n                <div class=\"step\">共100幅画，每4幅为一组，共分的组数： $100\\div4=25$(组)</div>\n                <div class=\"step flex-row\">\n                    <span>老师： $25\\times1=25$(人)</span>\n                    <span>学生： $25\\times3=75$(人)</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Problem 3 -->\n        <div class=\"problem\">\n            <div class=\"question\">3. 鸡、兔共笼，鸡比兔多26只，脚数共有274只，鸡、兔各有多少只？</div>\n            <div class=\"solution\">\n                <div class=\"method\">分组法</div>\n                <div class=\"step\">去掉26只鸡，脚数减少： $26\\times2=52$(只)</div>\n                <div class=\"step\">脚数共剩下： $274-52=222$(只)</div>\n                <div class=\"step\">把1只鸡和1只兔看作1组</div>\n                <div class=\"step\">每组里脚数： $2+4=6$(只)</div>\n                <div class=\"step\">222只脚可分成： $222\\div6=37$(组)</div>\n                <div class=\"step flex-row\">\n                    <span>鸡： $37\\times1+26=63$(只)</span>\n                    <span>兔： $37\\times1=37$(只)</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Problem 4 -->\n        <div class=\"problem\">\n            <div class=\"question\">4. 100个和尚吃100个馒头。大和尚一人吃3个，小和尚3人吃一个，</div>\n            <div class=\"question q-line\">大、小和尚各多少人？</div>\n            <div class=\"solution\">\n                <div class=\"method\">分组法</div>\n                <div class=\"step\">1个大和尚和3个小和尚共吃的馒头个数： $3+1=4$(个)</div>\n                <div class=\"step\">共100个馒头，每4个馒头为一组，共分的组数： $100\\div4=25$(组)</div>\n                <div class=\"step step-indent\">大和尚： $25\\times1=25$(人)</div>\n                <div class=\"step step-indent\">小和尚： $25\\times3=75$(人)</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
